    thumbnail strip to select a letterhead (or "None" for blank margin).
    Selected letterhead is stamped behind the generated PDF.
  * Added a dedicated Letterhead stamping page (/letterhead): pick a
    stored letterhead, view its auto-detected top/bottom margins, upload
    an existing PDF, and download the stamped result. Download-only — no
    server-side persistence, numbering, or case association.
  * Added Internship Certificate module: new /certificate page with a
    contenteditable A4 document editor and custom formatting toolbar
    (bold, italic, underline, alignment, font size, line spacing). PDF
    generation via ReportLab with auto-incrementing certificate numbers
    (CERT-XXXXX), stored in FS_ROOT/Certificates/<year>/. New DB table
    `certificates` and `certificate_next_number` app setting.
  * Certificate PDFs are now rendered entirely in Microsoft Times New
    Roman (resolved via fc-match, falling back to ReportLab's built-in
    Times only when the face is unavailable); the editor font-family
    picker was removed since all fonts normalise to Times New Roman.
  * Added Vakalatnama document library: admin uploads labelled PDF forms,
    all users can browse and download. New /vakalatnama page with card
    grid, new DB table `vakalatnamas`, stored in FS_ROOT/Vakalatnamas/.
